{"id":"real_no","lemma":"реально","pos":"adv","rank":899,"glosses":["really, in reality","objectively","specifically, factually"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/0/01/Ru-%D1%80%D0%B5%D0%B0%D0%BB%D1%8C%D0%BD%D0%BE.ogg/Ru-%D1%80%D0%B5%D0%B0%D0%BB%D1%8C%D0%BD%D0%BE.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Откуда ты знаешь, что реально?","en":"How do you know what's real?","words":[{"g":"whence, from where"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to know: to be familiar…","l":"знать"},{"g":"what / that"},null]},{"text":"Ты реально думаешь, что это невозможно?","en":"Do you really think it's impossible?","words":[{"g":"you"},null,{"g":"to think","l":"думать"},null,null,{"g":"it is impossible"}],"phrases":[[3,5,"why"]]},{"text":"Я себя реально плохо чувствую сегодня.","en":"I feel really bad today.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"oneself"},null,{"g":"bad, badly"},{"g":"to feel","l":"чувствовать"},{"g":"today"}]},{"text":"Ты меня реально бесишь.","en":"You really annoy me.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/728303","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"me","l":"я"},null,null]},{"text":"Это было реально страшно.","en":"That was really scary.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1283232","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"was","l":"быть"},null,{"g":"terrifyingly"}]}]}